  "prefLabel": "Rev 3402.04 Municipal Assessing Officials Procedure for Distribution of Form PA-7, “Notice of Intent to Cut Wood or Timber”",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3402.04 Municipal Assessing Officials Procedure for Distribution of Form PA-7, “Notice of Intent to Cut Wood or Timber”. After signing and assigning an operation number to a Form PA-7, the municipal assessing officials shall:\n\n(a) Within 5 business days, send a copy of the Form PA-7 to the DRA by:\n\n(1) Mail to:\n\nNew Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nP.O. Box 487\n\nConcord, NH 03302-0487;\n\n(2) E-mail at timber@dra.nh.gov; or\n\n(3) Fax at (603) 230-5947; and\n\n(b) Provide a copy of the signed Form PA-7 to the owner, and upon request to:\n\n(1) The logger;\n\n(2) The forester; or\n\n(3) The person responsible for the cut.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev3400.html"
}
